WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.708 --> 00:00:12.728
window washer fell.

2
00:00:13.569 --> 00:00:15.911
Zoom! Roxy flew down and caught him.

3
00:00:16.572 --> 00:00:17.732
The man hugged Roxy.

4
00:00:17.752 --> 00:00:19.274
"Thank you!"

5
00:00:19.294 --> 00:00:21.075
"No problem!"

6
00:00:22.096 --> 00:00:23.697
Roxy placed the man on the sidewalk.

7
00:00:24.518 --> 00:00:27.540
She started to look for Flash, but just then her watch beeped.

8
00:00:31.143 --> 00:00:32.585
Bloom," Roxy said.

9
00:00:32.605 --> 00:00:33.906
"What's wrong?"

10
00:00:33.926 --> 00:00:36.888
"Someone robbed Greenstar Grocery!"

11
00:00:37.249 --> 00:00:37.969
Mayor Bloom said.

12
00:00:37.989 --> 00:00:40.551
"I'm on my way!"

13
00:00:44.334 --> 00:00:46.156
Roxy flew toward Greenstar Grocery.

14
00:00:48.077 --> 00:00:49.038
Her watch beeped again.

15
00:00:52.921 --> 00:00:56.364
Bloom?" "There was another robbery," the mayor said.

16
00:00:56.384 --> 00:00:58.266
"It was at Midtown Shoes."

17
00:00:59.807 --> 00:01:00.748
Roxy turned around.

18
00:01:02.676 --> 00:01:03.797
Mayor Bloom called again.

19
00:01:07.898 --> 00:01:09.339
about Midtown Shoes, Rocket Girl.

20
00:01:10.019 --> 00:01:12.380
The thief just robbed West Slope Gallery."

21
00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:14.421
"Flick is fast!"

22
00:01:14.821 --> 00:01:15.481
Roxy thought.

23
00:01:16.482 --> 00:01:18.162
The phone on Mayor Bloom's desk rang.

24
00:01:18.182 --> 00:01:21.804
"Hello? Oh, that's terrible!"

25
00:01:23.004 --> 00:01:24.185
"What happened now, Mayor?"

26
00:01:24.485 --> 00:01:25.165
Roxy asked.

27
00:01:25.185 --> 00:01:28.607
"Three restaurants were robbed," Mayor Bloom said.

28
00:01:28.627 --> 00:01:31.208
"A sporting goods store was robbed too."

29
00:01:32.380 --> 00:01:33.221
Roxy sighed.

30
00:01:33.921 --> 00:01:35.503
"Don't worry, Mayor.

31
00:01:35.963 --> 00:01:37.124
I'll catch the thief."

32
00:01:37.825 --> 00:01:39.786
Roxy closed her watch and landed on a building.

33
00:01:43.990 --> 00:01:44.971
will I catch Flick?"

34
00:01:45.751 --> 00:01:46.712
Roxy tapped her chin.

35
00:01:46.732 --> 00:01:49.094
"I know!"

36
00:01:49.835 --> 00:01:50.876
Roxy flew up high.

37
00:01:51.837 --> 00:01:53.258
She could see the entire city.

38
00:01:53.278 --> 00:01:57.581
"I'll wait until I see Flick," Roxy thought.

39
00:01:58.202 --> 00:02:00.404
"Then I'll zoom down and catch her."

40
00:02:01.436 --> 00:02:02.157
Roxy waited.

41
00:02:02.997 --> 00:02:05.939
Finally she saw Flick zooming across Metro City Park.

42
00:02:06.819 --> 00:02:07.960
Roxy shot after her.

43
00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:11.922
"You can't catch me, Rocket Girl!"

44
00:02:12.462 --> 00:02:13.443
Flick ran faster.

45
00:02:13.463 --> 00:02:15.724
"Flick is quick!"

46
00:02:16.124 --> 00:02:16.765
Roxy thought.

47
00:02:17.785 --> 00:02:19.466
Flick shot past the 5K runners.

48
00:02:20.467 --> 00:02:21.727
Terrell and Jack were walking.

49
00:02:22.648 --> 00:02:25.429
Fwoosh! The wind from Flick knocked them over.

50
00:02:26.390 --> 00:02:27.250
Jack looked around.

51
00:02:27.270 --> 00:02:30.132
"Did something just fly past us?"

52
00:02:31.324 --> 00:02:32.644
Mara felt a gust of wind.

53
00:02:34.265 --> 00:02:36.145
Then she heard someone rushing up behind her.

54
00:02:36.706 --> 00:02:37.346
She gasped.

55
00:02:37.366 --> 00:02:39.446
"Rocket Girl!"

56
00:02:40.387 --> 00:02:43.127
Fwoosh! Flick zipped past the finish line.

57
00:02:43.747 --> 00:02:44.708
No one saw her though.

58
00:02:45.208 --> 00:02:46.228
She was too fast.

59
00:02:46.868 --> 00:02:48.089
Roxy shot by next.

60
00:02:49.089 --> 00:02:50.529
"Rocket Girl wins!"

61
00:02:50.889 --> 00:02:51.530
a man said.

62
00:02:52.370 --> 00:02:53.810
Roxy wasn't paying attention to him.

63
00:02:55.791 --> 00:02:57.531
She saw Flick running toward the lake.

64
00:02:58.312 --> 00:02:59.712
Roxy's eyes went wide.

65
00:03:00.672 --> 00:03:02.433
Flick ran across the water's surface!

66
00:03:02.453 --> 00:03:04.694
"Freeze breath!"

67
00:03:05.115 --> 00:03:05.815
Roxy thought.

68
00:03:06.535 --> 00:03:07.136
She blew.

69
00:03:07.696 --> 00:03:10.417
Whoo-ooo-oosh! The lake froze.

70
00:03:11.658 --> 00:03:13.279
Flick's feet stuck to the ice.

71
00:03:13.299 --> 00:03:17.241
"Ha!" Roxy said.

72
00:03:17.261 --> 00:03:19.822
"I caught you, Flick!"

73
00:03:20.863 --> 00:03:23.084
Flick tried to lift her feet, but they were stuck.

74
00:03:23.104 --> 00:03:26.706
"Gah!" Roxy grabbed her.

75
00:03:27.367 --> 00:03:29.808
Then she melted the ice and brought Flick to jail.

76
00:03:37.908 --> 00:03:39.029
Roxy returned to the park.

77
00:03:39.549 --> 00:03:42.191
The crowd cheered as she crossed the finish line last.

78
00:03:45.054 --> 00:03:46.395
"Good run, Roxy!"

79
00:03:46.655 --> 00:03:47.155
Jack said.

80
00:03:47.175 --> 00:03:49.137
"Thanks," Roxy said.

81
00:03:49.157 --> 00:03:50.578
"I guess I lost."

82
00:03:51.819 --> 00:03:54.401
"Yeah, but guess who won," Mara said.

83
00:03:54.421 --> 00:03:56.802
"Who?" Roxy asked.

84
00:03:57.403 --> 00:03:58.264
Terrell grinned.

85
00:03:58.764 --> 00:03:59.805
"Rocket Girl!"
